# See bootstash(5), /usr/share/doc/bootstash/QUICKSTART.md,
# and /usr/share/doc/bootstash/OPENVPN.md
# Add only overrides. Packaged operator keys: /usr/lib/bootstash/default-dist
# OIDC: bootstash provision-google (writes /etc/bootstash/oidc-google.json).
#
# DATA=/var/lib/bootstash
# LISTEN=127.0.0.1:8080
# PUBLIC_URL=
# ADMIN_USERS=
# OVPN_TOKEN=auto
